format: 3
name: a long narrowed to int out of int's range
class: Case
method: m
arg: 1b0000000100000005
expect: AGREE
note: (int) of a long keeps its low 32 bits on the JVM; the default frontend erases the cast. Closed by M5.
note: ADR-068 D13: on frontend=JAVAC this agrees with the JVM (Adr068SavedCasesOnJavacTest).
note: ADR-068 M6: on the only frontend, javac, AGREE; the JavaParser frontend answered DIVERGE M5 Value/Value.
---
public class Case {
    public static long m(long x) { return (int) x; }
}
